> 
> On 11/29/2012 04:21 PM, Takashi Iwai wrote:
> > Put INPUT_PIN_ATTR_FRONT after INPUT_PIN_ATTR_REAR, and define
> > INPUT_PIN_ATTR_LAST to point to the last element.
